{"id":"37c6790f9df50d9c","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-diamond-properties.md","title":"Diamond Principle Properties","display":"thm-diamond-properties — Diamond Principle Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-diamond-properties","aliases":["58-thm-diamond-properties","58-thm-jensen-diamond","Diamond Principle Properties","Jensen Diamond","Jensen Diamond Principle","$\\diamondsuit$ Principle","◇ Properties"],"display":"thm-diamond-properties — Diamond Principle Properties","depends_on":["[[58-thm-diamond-implies-CH]]","[[58-thm-V-equals-L]]","[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-diamond-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-diamond-properties</span><span>58-thm-jensen-diamond</span><span>Diamond Principle Properties</span><span>Jensen Diamond</span><span>Jensen Diamond Principle</span><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> Principle</span><span>◇ Properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond-properties — Diamond Principle Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f8060df33d3d96d\" href=\"?note=0f8060df33d3d96d\" title=\"58-thm-diamond-implies-CH\">58-thm-diamond-implies-CH</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a17c5ecd1b117ed\" href=\"?note=5a17c5ecd1b117ed\" title=\"58-thm-V-equals-L\">58-thm-V-equals-L</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2331ede3868d950e\" href=\"?note=2331ede3868d950e\" title=\"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md\">../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A,A,\\alpha,x\\in V\">\\(\\vec A,A,\\alpha,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (stationary-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in L)\\to\n\\exists\\vec A\\;\n\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega_1))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\;(\\vec A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega_1\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\mid A\\cap\\alpha=\\vec A(\\alpha)\\},\n\\omega_1\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in L)\\to\n\\exists\\vec A\\;\n\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega_1,\\mathcal P(\\omega_1))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\;(\\vec A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega_1\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\mid A\\cap\\alpha=\\vec A(\\alpha)\\},\n\\omega_1\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jensen: discovered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> while analyzing fine structure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> is &quot;small&quot; principle: just <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> guessing.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Stronger variants such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit^+\">\\(\\diamondsuit^+\\)</span> imply <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> implies CH and yields a Suslin tree; hence it refutes the usual Suslin Hypothesis rather than implying it.</li>\n<li>Stronger than CH: gives guessing, not just cardinality.</li>\n<li>The theorem is internalized as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=L\\to\\diamondsuit\">\\(V=L\\to\\diamondsuit\\)</span>; no object-language satisfaction relation is applied to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications: tree constructions, coding methods.</li>\n<li><code>58-thm-jensen-diamond</code> is merged here; it asserted the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\models \\diamondsuit\">\\(L \\models \\diamondsuit\\)</span> theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-diamond-implies-CH","status":"resolved","id":"0f8060df33d3d96d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-diamond-implies-CH]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-V-equals-L","status":"resolved","id":"5a17c5ecd1b117ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-V-equals-L]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2331ede3868d950e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-L-condensation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-5",